{"version":1,"content":"<p>視帝陳山聰出名熱愛跑步，即使近年因積極開拓不同市場而頻頻穿梭馬來西亞及內地，依然不忘抽空享受跑步的樂趣。</p><p>日前他便被粉絲發現與友人於海濱長廊競跑，間中則停下來聊天，事後相關短片於互聯網公諸同好，引起熱議。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T03:23:54.099515+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T03:01:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T03:17:15.355233+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T03:17:15.355233+00:00","content_hash":"028fa7da3903ee30598ac9a4c4c018cbba087661897b265144e13b6aeeeb3129","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}